  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "機器學習",
    "sub_ename": "MACHINE LEARNING",
    "describe_ch": "機器學習是電腦經由數據資料與過去經驗自動學習，找到運算規則並不斷提升程式效能的程序。近年來這個領域已經有了許多突破性的發展，奠定了人工智慧成功的基石。本課程將介紹機器學習的重要觀念與常用的數學模式，透過數學模式的推導及解說，使學生了解機器學習的基礎理論，具有發展與使用機器學習方法的能力。課程中將以Python的scikit-learn套件進行實作，讓學生能將機器學的方法應用在實際的資料上。",
    "describe_eh": "Machine learning is the learning process of computers through data and past experience, finding the computing rules and constantly improving the performance of programs. In recent years, there have several breakthrough developments in machine learning, laying the foundation for the success of artificial intelligence. This course will introduce the important concepts and fundamental mathematical models of machine learning. Python's scikit-learn suite will be used to implement the program, so that students can apply the methods of machine learning to real-world data.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
