  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CI02139",
    "sub_id": "69971",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>出席Attendances 10% (課堂課進行進行實體點名，線上非同步教學以影片觀看情形為出席依據); 作業 Homework 10%(包含手寫作業與程式作業); 隨堂測驗Quiz/ In-class examination(包含觀念測驗與程式實作)；期中考 Midterm examination 30%(以筆試方式進行); 期末專題 Final project 30%(以小組專題報告方式進行)</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "課堂禮儀Classrooms Protocol\n課程影片請於規定時間之前確實看完，切勿忽略不看，或矇混觀看次數。\n課堂授課時間，請準時到教室上課，切勿遲到早退。\n課程交流及網路禮儀Course Communication and Netiquette Guidelines\n上課期間禁止使用手機於課堂學習以外用途，如：通訊軟體聊天、看影片、玩遊戲等。\n學生責任Student Responsibilities\n上課期間保持安靜，專心聽講，勿相互交談、聊天，影響上課秩序。\n請注意教室環境整潔，下課離開教室請勿留下個人物品。",
    "course_pol_en": "Please watch the course videos before the specified time. Do not ignore them or confuse the number of times you have watched them. \nPlease arrive on time for class and do not be late or leave early. \nDuring class, you are prohibited from using your mobile phone for purposes other than classroom learning, such as chatting on communication software, watching videos, playing games, etc. \nDuring class, stay quiet and listen attentively. Do not talk or chat with each other to affect the order of the class. \nPlease pay attention to the cleanliness of the classroom environment. Please do not leave personal belongings behind when leaving the classroom after class.",
    "course_rem": "本課程以全英文方式授課，課程影片請同學多看幾次，以熟習全英的學習。",
    "course_rem_en": "This course is taught entirely in English. Please watch the course video several times to become familiar with learning in English.",
    "ais_meno": "<ol>\n\t<li>嚴禁作業與程式抄襲與考試舞弊。</li>\n\t<li>作業與程式不可抄襲其他同學作業程式、或網路，違者該次作業或程式以0分計算。發生三次抄襲者，本學期作業成績以0分計算。</li>\n\t<li>考試不可參閱未允許之資料，或其他人的解答，違者視為舞弊，該次考試以0分計算，情節嚴重者送校規處分。</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<ol>\n\t<li>Copying homework and programs, as well as cheating in exams, are strictly prohibited.</li>\n\t<li>Homework and programs cannot be copied from other students&#39; homework programs or the internet. Violators will receive 0 points for this homework or program. If there are three instances of plagiarism, the homework grade for this semester will be calculated as 0 points.</li>\n\t<li>The exam cannot refer to unauthorized data or other people&#39;s answers. Violators will be considered as cheating, and the exam will be counted as 0 points. Those with serious circumstances will be punished according to school regulations.</li>\n</ol>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
